{"chunk_id": "DOC001_chunk_0000", "document_id": "DOC001", "title": "Getting Started", "source": "data\\documents\\getting_started.md", "access_level": "public", "text": "# Getting Started\n\n## Creating an account\n\nUsers can create an account by opening the registration page and entering their email address and password. The system sends a verification email before activating the account.\n\n## Resetting a password\n\nIf a user forgets their password, they can select Forgot Password on the login page. A password reset link is sent to their registered email address. The link expires after 30 minutes.\n\n## Contacting support\n\nUsers can contact support through the Help Center. They should include a description of the problem and any relevant error message.", "embedding": [-0.06576409935951233, -0.08463860303163528, -0.017489569261670113, 0.030340297147631645, -0.04734279587864876, 0.05992960184812546, 0.044353142380714417, 0.00476787518709898, 0.02785419300198555, 0.03638855740427971, 0.022540021687746048, 0.00258988537825644, 0.06268961727619171, -0.022870175540447235, -0.023408716544508934, 0.01865854673087597, -0.0895066186785698, 0.007147400639951229, -0.03518484905362129, -0.0004006160597782582, 0.005864978302270174, -0.13039803504943848, -0.037598591297864914, 0.0506981797516346, 0.0032221104484051466, -0.09065601229667664, 0.03237876668572426, 0.03779454529285431, -0.03763115778565407, 0.07329053431749344, 0.06753315776586533, 0.014535270631313324, -0.01134792435914278, -0.01923815719783306, 0.012319337576627731, -0.016179027035832405, -0.02132515050470829, 0.06417577713727951, -0.030759835615754128, -0.08745592087507248, -0.10476253181695938, -0.04971368983387947, -0.07391045987606049, 0.09649210423231125, -0.0038764693308621645, 0.07446179538965225, -0.015246557071805, 0.05960555002093315, -0.011598891578614712, -0.006472242064774036, 0.07382696866989136, -0.058368291705846786, 0.06504008173942566, -0.10646720975637436, -0.0936344563961029, 0.02972062118